<title>usa: RESEARCH ALERT-Cowen boosts Boeing EPS view.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Cowen boosts Boeing EPS view.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen raised its 1997 earnings estimates for the combined Boeing-McDonnell Douglas entity to $5.95 per share from $5.65 a share.</p>
<p>-- Cowen also raised its 1998 earnings estimates to $7.30 a share from $7.15 a share.</p>
<p>-- Cowen did not provide additional information.</p>
<p>-- Boeing gained 5-1/8 to 101-7/8 in midday trading.</p>
</text>
